# Frontend React

Follow `FlowDesk-Frontend/docs/frontend-coding-standards.md`.

- Features: `src/features/<name>/{components,hooks,api.ts,slice.ts,types.ts}`.
- One Axios client: auth header, unwrap `ApiResponse`, global errors, 401 refresh.
- React Query (or RTK Query) = server state. Redux/`useState` = client UI state only.
- Zod schemas first; `z.infer` for TS types.
- `ErrorCode` → toast map aligned with backend. Env for API URL — no hardcoded URLs.
- Scaffold client, ErrorBoundary, mapper before feature screens.
